From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:40:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] params: name preset 2's first column FPS

The horizontal bar only ever runs under gamescope, so the engine label
says the same word every time. hide_engine_names names the column FPS
and drops the small FPS superscript after the number.
---
 src/overlay_params.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/overlay_params.cpp b/src/overlay_params.cpp
index c05f7a1..9d2b41a 100644
--- a/src/overlay_params.cpp
+++ b/src/overlay_params.cpp
@@ -1315,6 +1315,7 @@ void presets(int preset, struct overlay_params *params, bool inherit) {
          add_to_options(params, "horizontal", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "legacy_layout", "0");
          add_to_options(params, "fps", "1");
+         add_to_options(params, "hide_engine_names", "1");
          add_to_options(params, "table_columns", "20");
          add_to_options(params, "frame_timing", "0");
          add_to_options(params, "frametime", "0");
